# Verification Checklist — Guest Users B2B Lab

---

## Exercise 1 — Single Guest Invite ✅

- [ ] Signed in with Guest Inviter role or User Administrator
- [ ] Navigated to **Identity → Users → All Users**
- [ ] Selected **+ New user → Invite external user**
- [ ] Entered a valid individual email address (no group email, no + symbol)
- [ ] Added display name for the guest
- [ ] Clicked **Invite**
- [ ] Verified guest account appears in **All Users** list
- [ ] Confirmed **User type** column shows **Guest**

